% Considering only the direct source component (i.e., in noise-free and anechoic conditions) the PHAT-weighted CPSD in \cref{eq: psi} is equal to a phase shift, i.e., ${\phi}_{i,j} = \exp(-\ji \omega \tau_{i,j}(\pbf))$ \cite{madhu2008acoustic, huang2008time, pertila2018multichannel}. 
