The results confirm that most violations are of negligible size. Most violations have negligible size, with the mass concentrated near zero, even when violations occur at distant perturbation steps. This observation further supports that the neural network predictions remain robust and economically consistent in the neighborhood of the original input configurations, with only minor deviations arising further away.


