\section*{Data Availability}
Both Citi Bike trip data and New York City’s bike-lane network are available for download from Citi Bike (https://Citi Bikenyc.com/system-data), and the NYC Open Data Portal (https://opendata.cityofnewyork.us/), respectively. 


