\wt(\la) = \al_1+2\al_2 + 2\al_3+\al_4+\al_5 = \La_3 - s_2 s_1s_3s_2 s_5s_4 s_3 (\La_3),
$$
which means that $\La_3 - \wt(\la) \in \weyl \cdot \La_3$, and 
$
\bfs_\bfi(\la) = (1,1,1,1,1,0,1,1,0).
$

The diagonal hook decomposition of $\la$ is $H(\la) = (H_1, H_2)$, where
$$
H_1 =\begin{tabular}{ |c|c|c| } 
