\caption{The plots of the Doppler signal, $(C_\ell - C^{(\rm no\, timedelay)}_\ell) / C^{(\rm no\, timedelay)}_\ell$, in the total magnification angular power spectrum as a function of multipole $\ell$: at source redshifts $z_S \,{=}\, 0.5$ (top left), $z_S \,{=}\, 1$ (top right), $z_S \,{=}\, 3$ (bottom left), and $z_S \,{=}\, 4.5$ (bottom right). Shaded regions denote cosmic variance.}\label{fig:timedelaySignal}
