\mE \sup_{0\le s \le t}I_1(s)&\le Kt^\delta \big(\mE \sup_{0\leq s \leq t}|X^{\epsilon}_{s}-X^{\tilde{\epsilon}}_{s}|^{2}+ \sup_{0\le s \le t} W_{2}^{2}(\mu_s^{\epsilon},\mu_s^{\tilde\epsilon})\big)\\
