$$\|\nabla u^{\lambda, \mu^{\epsilon_{1}}}-\nabla u^{\lambda, \mu^{\epsilon_{2}}}\|_{T, \infty}\leq C(\mE[\sup_{0\leq s\leq T}|X^{\epsilon_{1}}_s-X^{\epsilon_{2}}_s|^{2}])^{\frac{1}{2}} + |\epsilon_{2}- \epsilon_{1}|),$$
