From above lemma,  we have that $\|\nabla u^{\lambda, \mu^{0}}\|_{T, \infty}\leq \frac{1}{2}.$ Let $\theta_{t}^{\lambda, \mu^{\epsilon}}(x)=x+u_{t}^{\lambda, \mu^{\epsilon}}(x),$  $\theta_{t}^{\lambda, \mu^{0}}(x)=x+u_{t}^{\lambda, \mu^{0}}(x).$  Using It\^{o}'s formula to $\theta_{t}^{\lambda, \mu^{\epsilon}}(x),$  it yields
