\title{Learning to optimize convex risk measures: The cases of utility-based shortfall risk  and optimized certainty equivalent risk}

\author{\name Sumedh Gupte \email sumedh.gupte@tcs.com \\
       \addr TCS Research
       \AND
       \name Prashanth L. A.\thanks{A portion of this work was done when Prashanth L. A. 
