\section{Estimation of UBSR and OCE Risk Measures}
\label{sec:estimation}

In this section, we discuss techniques to estimate the UBSR and the OCE risk of a given random variable $X$. In practice, the true distribution of $X$ is unavailable, and instead one relies on the samples of $X$ to estimate the UBSR. We use the sample average approximation (SAA) technique \cite{saa-intro-shapiro-alexander,robust-stoc-appx-nemirovski-shapiro,shapiro_book} for both, UBSR estimation and OCE estimation. Such a scheme for UBSR estimation was proposed and analyzed by \citet{zhaolin2016ubsrest}. A similar scheme for OCE was proposed and analyzed by \citet{JMLR-LAP-SPB}.

