The following lemma combines the results of Lemma \ref{lemma:integral} and Lemma \ref{LemmaFlashGordon} to derive the asymptotic behavior of those weighted sums, which will play a central role in the computation of both the variance and the fourth cumulant of the estimator $\fNL$.
\begin{lemma}\label{lemma:eta}
	Let $\eta _{\ell _{1}\ell _{2}\ell _{3}}$ be given by Equation \eqref{eq:eta} and $\kappal$ be defined as
