\subsubsection{Local Profiler Workflow}
As illustrated in Figure \ref{local profiler}, the local profiler functions as follows, supported by the two previously mentioned components: 
\begin{enumerate}
    \item  The agent receives commands from the controller that defines the profiling configurations.
    \item  The agent initiates a Prometheus client, setting up Prometheus metrics.
