\textbf{Remark 2:}  \emph{Specially, if the AFDM system satisfies the narrowband approximation conditions mentioned in \textbf{Remark 1}, i.e.} $B = N \varDelta f \ll f_c $ \emph{and} $\alpha_i \ll 1 / (BT) = 1/N$, \emph{\eqref{11} can be simplified as}
\begin{align}\label{12}
	y_{\text{T}}(t) \approx \sum_{i=1}^{P} {h}_i {x}_{\text{T}} ( t - \tau_i )  e^{j 2 \pi \nu_i t } + \omega_{\text{T}} (t),
