$L_{\eta}[X \cap \omega_1^N]$ we have that} \\&
			L_{\eta} [X \cap \omega_1^N] \models  \forall n ( n \in x\rightarrow T^1_{n}  \text{ has an $\omega_1$-branch}  \\&
