\item $E(Y) \cap [\omega, c_0) = \emptyset$.
\item For all $\beta$, $E(Y) \cap [c_{\beta}, c_{\beta} + \omega)$ codes a well-ordering of type $c_{\beta+1}$.
\item For all $\beta$, $E(Y) \cap [c_{\beta}+\omega, c_{\beta+1})= \emptyset$.
