Notably, none of the existing methods was developed for the elliptical model \eqref{eq_em}, which is reflected in their erratic numerical performance throughout this section: they sometimes perform well, but often do not approximate the nominal level well or fail to detect differences reliably. In contrast, the proposed method -- explicitly designed for elliptical models -- performs reliably across all scenarios under consideration.

