%compatible with the packages conforming the scientific Python ecosystem. With that purpose in mind, dcor is an early adopter of the Python array API standard.
\end{abstract}
\noindent {\bf Keywords:} Categorical Gini correlation, Gini distance correlation, dependence measure, statistical inference, Python implementation

